{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Medieval Sandbox RPG: Weave Your Destiny</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/fee5e860689227f4789b095a59f597a9.avif?t=1756810315\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eThe End of History\u300f is a sandbox-style strategy RPG set in a medieval-inspired world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the protagonist, you leave your foster parent's home one day and embark on a journey as an unknown wanderer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the motives of numerous NPCs intertwine, and cooperation and betrayal collide,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you become a part of this world and can live freely as you choose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stop the Collapse of the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/9377786f11625d51f39a0f5f466f6474.avif?t=1756810315\" width=1414 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is singular: to stop the collapse of the world. The world is heading towards destruction fueled by rising hatred and division. Every action has consequences, and you must observe their effects carefully.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live Freely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/e90f2586439986519b1e4a59820cdf34.avif?t=1756810315\" width=1532 height=624 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From being a nameless entity to becoming a thief, trader, knight, or even a king, your existence in the world is up to you. Your choices shape your destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >'Obelisk' Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/c90b200dd7c36ec4401cbe9c7ca4b7d9.avif?t=1756810315\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This massive and mysterious structure holds the wisdom of a seemingly infinite world. Its existence is now shrouded in mystery, with fragments scattered across the world to piece together its secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Unique Story\u2500\u2500<br>This is not a heroic tale, but a record of historical observation.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/d88fc31a22edce6864057f618156981c.avif?t=1756810315\" data-has-big width=800 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aftermath of battles, the words exchanged, the small, forgotten choices\u2500\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all of these stir emotions and change actions. NPCs will continue to live their lives without you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, your decisions create ripples in their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not depict a predetermined scenario, but a unique and unrepeatable history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >born from the player's involvement.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2953520?t=1756810315","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756810315","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/e4d1c0b69fd29fe1d63f3297f5aec4a87fe9d7f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756810315","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/e4d1c0b69fd29fe1d63f3297f5aec4a87fe9d7f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756810315","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Medieval Sandbox RPG: Weave Your Destiny</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/fee5e860689227f4789b095a59f597a9.avif?t=1756810315\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eThe End of History\u300f is a sandbox-style strategy RPG set in a medieval-inspired world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the protagonist, you leave your foster parent's home one day and embark on a journey as an unknown wanderer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world where the motives of numerous NPCs intertwine, and cooperation and betrayal collide,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you become a part of this world and can live freely as you choose.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Stop the Collapse of the World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/9377786f11625d51f39a0f5f466f6474.avif?t=1756810315\" width=1414 height=392 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mission is singular: to stop the collapse of the world. The world is heading towards destruction fueled by rising hatred and division. Every action has consequences, and you must observe their effects carefully.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live Freely</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/e90f2586439986519b1e4a59820cdf34.avif?t=1756810315\" width=1532 height=624 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From being a nameless entity to becoming a thief, trader, knight, or even a king, your existence in the world is up to you. Your choices shape your destiny.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >'Obelisk' Mystery</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/c90b200dd7c36ec4401cbe9c7ca4b7d9.avif?t=1756810315\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This massive and mysterious structure holds the wisdom of a seemingly infinite world. Its existence is now shrouded in mystery, with fragments scattered across the world to piece together its secrets.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A Unique Story\u2500\u2500<br>This is not a heroic tale, but a record of historical observation.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/extras/d88fc31a22edce6864057f618156981c.avif?t=1756810315\" data-has-big width=800 height=560 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The aftermath of battles, the words exchanged, the small, forgotten choices\u2500\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >all of these stir emotions and change actions. NPCs will continue to live their lives without you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, your decisions create ripples in their stories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game does not depict a predetermined scenario, but a unique and unrepeatable history</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >born from the player's involvement.</p>","developers":["Tatamibeya \u7573\u90e8\u5c4b"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953520/d25bc8f0439084646011f7d03c677c263478c585/header.jpg?t=1756810315","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a92024 Tatamibeya All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<s